# uv's resolved lock. Not committed: nothing here installs from it - both images
# and every CI job resolve from pyproject.toml with pip - so a tracked lock is a
# file that must be maintained while gating nothing, and it silently went stale
# twice. If a deploy is ever made to install with `uv sync --frozen`, commit it
# again: then it pins what actually ships and cannot drift unnoticed.
uv.lock
